---
description: Conventions for Duct landing pages and shared assets
globs: ["*.html", "assets/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---

When editing landing pages or shared assets:

- Set `<link rel="canonical">` to the production URL (`https://getduct.ai/...`).
- Keep shared CSS and JS in `assets/duct.css` and `assets/duct.js`; do not inline or duplicate.
- When adding a new page, add its URL to `sitemap.xml`.
- Form actions use Google Forms: set `data-form-url` and `data-entry-id` on submit buttons as in existing pages (e.g. `for-product-intelligence.html`, `for-organic-growth.html`).
